    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nStep Inside Our 3 Bedroom Show Home | Available to View by Appointment\n\nThis highly anticipated release features a selection of 3-bedroom terraced and semi-detached homes, including The Ash, The Holly and The Beech, located on the much sought-after Oakmount Drive, together with just two 4-bedroom semi-detached Elm style homes.\n\nWith limited availability, this release offers a rare opportunity to secure a new home in one of Wicklow's most desirable communities.\n\nA sophisticated collection of expansive, design-forward 3, 4 & 5 bedroom homes, created for those seeking uncompromising quality. \n\nRegister your interest at www.altidoregardens.ie/Oakmount \n\nPoised in the foothills of the Wicklow Mountains, Oakmount emerges as the signature chapter of a thriving community at Altidore Gardens. A place where architectural elegance and meticulous craftsmanship elevate everyday living. Where each home is curated to inspire a lasting sense of pride and place, shaped for those who value comfort, connection, and enduring quality, and creating a setting where a legacy of belonging is built to last. \n\nThese homes capture the essence of timeless beauty and effortless elegance. Crafted to the highest standards with advanced energy efficiency, smart heating, and provision of infrastructure for electric vehicles, they offer sustainable, future-ready living. Every detail has been thoughtfully considered to endure, creating homes of exceptional quality that inspire pride, foster community, and leave a lasting legacy for generations to come. \n\nRanging in size from 115 sq m to 219 sq m, each home features spacious, intelligently planned layouts with light-filled interiors. At the heart of each home, floor-to-ceiling contemporary shaker kitchens create a refined focal point, dressed in quartz-stone worktops and matching splash-backs. Hidden delights such as pantries, laundry rooms, and quietly clever storage niches tuck themselves seamlessly into the design, making everyday living feel effortless. The bathrooms continue this sense of gentle indulgence, with wall-hung wash-hand basin cabinets, back-lit mirrors, and striking large-profile tiling in both the main bathrooms and ensuites, creating serene spaces that feel wonderfully removed from the ordinary. \n\nThe Linear Park the jewel in the crown at the heart of the community \n\nAt the heart of Altidore Gardens, a newly opened 8.1-hectare linear park stands as the jewel in the crown of this thoughtfully designed neighbourhood. It weaves wildflower meadows, planted woodlands, and natural habitats into a 1.5km loop of walking, running, and cycling routes -creating a vibrant green space where residents, wildlife, and the wider Newtownmountkennedy community can connect, explore, and flourish. \n\nWhere connections grow and roots run deep. \n\nNestled within the enchanting woodlands and glens of the Garden County, Newtownmountkennedy is a village where natural beauty meets everyday convenience. Its charming streets are filled with boutique shops, artisanal cafés, and local schools, while the breathtaking Wicklow Mountains lie just beyond, offering endless opportunities for outdoor adventure and quiet reflection. Here, a vibrant community spirit blends effortlessly with the tranquility of the surrounding landscape, creating a truly inspiring place to call home. \n\nConnected yet wonderfully serene, Oakmount offers residents the best of both worlds: easy access to the N11 and M11, with regular Bus Éireann and TFI services providing seamless links to Dublin and nearby towns.\n\nPlease note that the images shown are of our 3-bedroom semi-detached 'Holly' style unit."
      },
